<title>JAPAN: Germany&quot;s economic problems structural - Schieber.</title>
<headline>Germany&quot;s economic problems structural - Schieber.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helmut Schieber, a member of the Bundesbank Directorate, said on Thursday that Germany&quot;s economic problems are structural and are not caused by problems of foreign exchange rates.</p>
<p>Schieber was speaking at an EMU seminar in Tokyo.</p>
</text>
